antigravity-spaces
==================

Provenance
----------
This repository is a modified derivative of AFSlayer/antigravity-server
(https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It was derived from upstream commit
33ccaeb89cd665cb39051a883fc047c42a40de2c ("fix: update patch anchors for
Antigravity 2.26.0 (#64)"). Most of the Go source in this repository is
upstream code reused unchanged. It is not an independent from-scratch work and
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Google. See DISCLAIMER.md
(upstream notice, reproduced unchanged).

This snapshot corresponds to commit 5228931111b62795ffa136a8d528b0fc87e330c7
of the private working repository it was published from.

Changes relative to upstream (Apache-2.0 Section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------
Modified files:
  .gitignore
  README.md
  cmd/agy-server/run.go
  internal/assets/assets.go
  internal/lsproc/geminiconfig.go
  internal/lsproc/launch.go
  internal/patches/patches.go
  internal/patches/patches_test.go
  internal/patches/registry.go
  internal/signin/signin.go

Added files:
  Dockerfile, entrypoint.sh, docs/REA_ANALYSIS_AND_PARITY.md,
  internal/assets/vendor/** (third-party assets, see below),
  internal/lsproc/geminiconfig_test.go,
  NOTICE (this file)

Upstream files not included in this snapshot:
  .goreleaser.yaml, SECURITY.md, README.{es,ja,ko,pt-BR,zh-CN}.md,
  deploy/*, docs/assets/*, docs/index.html, scripts/*
  (LICENSE and DISCLAIMER.md were restored unchanged for publication.)

Summary of functional changes: Remote Control relay setting forced off
(DisableRemoteControl), language_server launched with
--app_data_dir antigravity-cli and OAuth token paths synchronised with the
agy CLI (including normalized base ~/.gemini candidate path resolution across
both cold startup and sign-in, with regression tests in
internal/lsproc/geminiconfig_test.go), default IDE version 2.26.0, synchronous
bundle pre-warm, PASSWORD env fallback, ReplaceAll patch support, five patches
rewriting Google-hosted font/icon URLs to locally served /__agy/vendor/ assets,
and Docker/entrypoint files for Hugging Face Docker Spaces.

